mber 2020", "url": "https://www.volexity.com/blog/2020/11/06/oceanlotus-extending-cyber-espionage-operations-through-fake-websites/"}, {"description": "Amnesty International. (2021, February 24). Vietnamese activists targeted by notorious hacking group. Retrieved March 1, 2021.", "source_name": "Amnesty Intl. Ocean Lotus February 2021", "url": "https://www.amnestyusa.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Click-and-Bait_Vietnamese-Human-Rights-Defenders-Targeted-with-Spyware-Attacks.pdf"}, {"description": "Ray, V. and Hayashi, K. (2019, February 1). Tracking OceanLotus’ new Downloader, KerrDown. Retrieved October 1, 2021.", "source_name": "Unit 42 KerrDown February 2019", "url": "https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/tracking-oceanlotus-new-downloader-kerrdown/"}], "id": "relationship--4ef9490e-e347-4f4e-aa6f-c082e02349fc", "modified": "2026-07-31T18:47:44.364Z", "object_marking_refs": ["marking-definition--fa42a846-8d90-4e51-bc29-71d5b4802168"], "relationship_type": "uses", "revoked": false, "source_ref": "intrusion-set--247cb30b-955f-42eb-97a5-a89fef69341e", "spec_version": "2.1", "target_ref": "malware--a7881f21-e978-4fe4-af56-92c9416a2616", "type": "relationship", "x_mitre_attack_spec_version": "3.3.0", "x_mitre_deprecated": false, "x_mitre_modified_by_ref": "identity--c78cb6e5-0c4b-4611-8297-d1b8b55e40b5"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-8554', 0, 261, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', '679A6B295446FEA3D506A2765A460BCBCA25869BFFB2C509E0F3EAB01057B49B', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "STRUCTURED_DATA"}')
