 7). FIN7 Spear Phishing Campaign Targets Personnel Involved in SEC Filings. Retrieved March 8, 2017.", "source_name": "FireEye FIN7 March 2017", "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20180808125108/https:/www.fireeye.com/blog/threat-research/2017/03/fin7_spear_phishing.html"}, {"description": "Singleton, C. and Kiefer, C. (2020, September 28). Ransomware 2020: Attack Trends Affecting Organizations Worldwide. Retrieved September 20, 2021.", "source_name": "IBM Ransomware Trends September 2020", "url": "https://securityintelligence.com/posts/ransomware-2020-attack-trends-new-techniques-affecting-organizations-worldwide/"}, {"description": "The Record. (2022, January 7). FBI: FIN7 hackers target US companies with BadUSB devices to install ransomware. Retrieved January 14, 2022.", "source_name": "FBI Flash FIN7 USB", "url": "https://therecord.media/fbi-fin7-hackers-target-us-companies-with-badusb-devices-to-install-ransomware/"}], "id": "relationship--7577e14c-ceba-4646-98ce-41e7fa9ae851", "modified": "2026-07-31T20:48:32.014Z", "object_marking_refs": ["marking-definition--fa42a846-8d90-4e51-bc29-71d5b4802168"], "relationship_type": "uses", "revoked": false, "source_ref": "intrusion-set--3753cc21-2dae-4dfb-8481-d004e74502cc", "spec_version": "2.1", "target_ref": "malware--72f54d66-675d-4587-9bd3-4ed09f9522e4", "type": "relationship", "x_mitre_attack_spec_version": "3.3.0", "x_mitre_deprecated": false, "x_mitre_modified_by_ref": "identity--c78cb6e5-0c4b-4611-8297-d1b8b55e40b5"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-9100', 0, 289, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', 'AAA2791279FB9C8F0B3682FBB4337DFDF47C5FD765D7EDA1B718C98EA976ABE5', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "STRUCTURED_DATA"}')
